  "job_B9.2.4_20251003_114951": {
    "chunk_text": ", \u00e6r he & \u00e6fter \u00fe\u00e6m he gewonn Drancas \u00fe\u00e6t folc, & Euergetas, & Paramomenas, & Assapias, & monega N\u00e6s his scinlac ne his hergiung on \u00fea fremdan ane, ac he gelice slog & hiende \u00fea \u00fee him on siml \u00c6st he ofslog Amintas his modrian sunu, & si\u00fe\u00fean his bro\u00f0or, & \u00fea Parmenion his \u00feegn, & \u00fea & Clitus, se w\u00e6s \u00e6g\u00feer ge his \u00feegn ge \u00e6r Philippuses his f\u00e6der, \u00fea hie sume si\u00fee druncne \u00e6t \u00dea s\u00e6gde se Clitus for ealdre hyldo \u00fe\u00e6t Philippus mare h\u00e6fde gedon \u00feonne he. He \u00fea Alexander ahleop, & hiene for \u00fe\u00e6re s\u00e6gene ofslog. He Alexander toecan \u00fe\u00e6m \u00fee he hienende w\u00e6s \u00e6g\u00feer ge his agen folc ge o\u00f0erra cyninga, he w\u00e6s Ra\u00fee \u00e6fter \u00fe\u00e6m he for mid firde on Chorasmas, & on Dacos & him to gafolgieldum hie geniedde. Chalisten \u00feone Philosofum he ofslog, his emnscolere, \u00f0e hi \u00e6tg\u00e6dere gel\u00e6rede w\u00e6ron \u00e6t \u00c6fter \u00fe\u00e6m he for on Indie, to \u00feon \u00fe\u00e6t he his rice gebr\u00e6dde o\u00fe \u00feone eastgarsecg. On \u00fe\u00e6m si\u00fee he geeode Nisan, India heafodburg, & ealle \u00fea beorgas \u00fee mon D\u00e6dolas h\u00e6tt; & eall \u00c6fter \u00fe\u00e6m \u00fee Alexander h\u00e6fde ealle Indie him to gewildon gedon, buton anre byrg, seo w\u00e6s He \u00fea Alexander hit swi\u00feost for \u00fe\u00e6m angann \u00fee he wolde \u00fe\u00e6t his m\u00e6r\u00fea w\u00e6ren maran \u00feonne \u00c6fter",
